{
  "uid": "deluge-exporter-influxdb1",
  "title": "Deluge Exporter (InfluxDB 1.x)",
  "description": "Sample dashboard for DelugeExporter (https://github.com/clara-j/DelugeExporter), InfluxDB 1.x queries. Pick the InfluxQL data source whose database is the exporter's INFLUXDB_DATABASE. Queries aggregate per torrent, so they also work with YEAR_TAG=true.",
